  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aid Fund for Syria II - Crown Agents Bank</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The second phase of the Aid Fund for Syria (AFS) is a continuation of the existing multi-donor humanitarian fund, with the Fund Management Agent being contracted by the FCDO. This iteration broadens the scope to respond to humanitarian needs across the whole of Syria, instead of focusing on the North West. Adam Smith International was the successful bidder of the competitive procurement and will therefore remain the fund management agent, ensuring continuity of service for steering board members, donors and implementing partners. A five-year contract enables AFS to deliver on our vision for localised, longer-term more sustainable programming.</narrative>
  </description>
